<%#
# The language of an account, as text

No list to pick from: the platform is Russian only for now. The line says what language the account has, and nothing is
sent with the form.

## Local variables:

- `field`: a `LanguageField`; `field.data` is the language code of the account.
%>
<p class="m-0 text-sm text-n-slate-12" data-testid="account-language">
  <span class="font-medium"><%= t('helpers.label.account.locale') %>:</span> <%= field.to_s %>
</p>
